<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Thornguard</ansi> (enchanting recipe)

Chitin thorns erupt from the shield's face, punishing attackers who
strike it.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Recipe ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       enchanting (minimum 18)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     enchanting circle
  <ansi fg="yellow">Target:</ansi>      shield / offhand (must be equipped)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> chrysalis setting (x1), mutation catalyst (x1),
                binding paste (x2)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Time:</ansi>        5 rounds
  <ansi fg="yellow">Reserve:</ansi>     health (1% at tier 0, scaling with tier)

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Effect ━━━</ansi>

Deals return damage to attackers.

The enchantment grows stronger through combat use, advancing
through five tiers of increasing power and reserve cost.

